logist","Molecular Biology / Genomics Specialist","Senior Lab Technologist","Technical Specialist / Laboratory Supervisor","Laboratory Manager / Technical Lead","Research / R&D Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Genetics + strong molecular biology fundamentals + hands-on DNA/RNA extraction + PCR + gel electrophoresis + exposure to qPCR/sequencing + laboratory QA/QC + scientific documentation + one serious genetics research project + basic R/Python + bioinformatics fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest graduate profile combines wet-lab competence with computational genetics. A student who can reliably execute molecular workflows, maintain high-quality laboratory records, interpret experimental results and perform basic genomic data analysis will have substantially more career flexibility than someone with only theoretical genetics knowledge."}]}]}